  "adaptations": [
    "Extract pure message conversion, history repair, endpoint and thinking helpers from mother sources; retain original source hashes for comparison.",
    "Keep transport, configuration, credentials, model groups, selection and retry ownership in Limare; exclude mother OAuthHTTPClient, TokenBoxRegistry, config loader and session binding/configuration DTOs.",
    "Use ImageIO for macOS image conversion; receive host-owned capability metadata and diagnostic sink.",
    "Add positive minimal tier; reject unknown wire tiers; hide Ultra in host UI.",
    "Use SwiftAnthropic 2.2.0 MessageParameter, MessageStreamResponse and StreamHandler for signed/redacted thinking. Preserve full nested JSON schemas.",
    "NativeWireCodec and NativeStreamDecoder expose pure request/event projection for the existing Limare transport; no parallel session or persistent protocol state.",
    "Public native entry point carries per-call signed thinking and thought signatures through host-owned conversation metadata.",
    "Native thinkingControlJSON is shared by UI distinct-control admission and request serialization; output caps deduplicate equal budgets.",
    "Kimi Code uses host-selected compatible effort profile; official four-model catalog remains in Limare.",
    "Use the exact snake_case encoder/decoder strategies from SwiftAnthropic DefaultAnthropicService/Endpoint; its StreamHandler collects signatures.",
    "Preserve complete inline tool input and nested original JSON keys before conversion to canonical stream events."
  ],
